! ja_ax1a "IBOX-1", routine IBH30-IBH40, p.30 (octal 004301.00-
! 004312.40): "%LVNI% **** LOAD VALUE NEGATIVE IMMEDIATE".
!
! WHY THIS BLOCK.  LVNI was one of eight modeled index operations a
! coverage screen found in ZERO suite programs, all eight then
! confirmed by poisoning them at once.  ja_ax1a's routine list (pp.3-4)
! gives it one line, "Same as LV & SV", and because that list is in
! PROGRAM ORDER it placed the block before V+IC (p.33) and after the KC
! section -- one page render found it.
!
! IT IS THE SMALLEST SELF-CHECKING BLOCK IN THE SUITE, twenty
! half-words with no constants outside itself, and it works because
! LVNI's result is NEGATIVE.  Each test loads minus an immediate, adds
! one fixed positive half-word, and stores the sum over a
! branch-to-self:
!
!   LVNI,$X1,<n>   value = -<n>
!   V+,$X1,IBH39   value += IBH39, which is 4311.44 -- and IBH39 is a
!                  BD,$ sitting INSIDE the block, used as data
!   SV,$X1,IBH3x   the sum becomes a branch
!
! So the arithmetic only lands on a valid link if the sign is right: a
! LVNI that loaded PLUS the immediate would push every sum past the
! chain instead of walking back down it.  The four immediates are .32,
! 1.0, 1.32 and 2.0 -- half a word, one word, one and a half, two --
! so the four sums step down by half-words from 4311.04 to 4307.44.
!
! THE CHAIN, all four manufactured links on it:
!
!   IBH34 -> IBH38 -> IBH36 -> IBH37 -> IBH35 -> IBH40
!
! and IBH35 is the one link the block does NOT rewrite: the listing
! annotates it "REMAINS BD,IBH 40", the exit.  Every target matches the
! listing's own comments.
!
! IBH40's two NOPs are MEANT to be executed; the block ends by falling
! through them.
!
! AND "REACHES PASS" IS NOT A CHECK HERE, which is the opposite of
! ibox1_vic_chain and ibox1_vpc_chain and had to be measured to find
! out.  With LVNI made to load PLUS the immediate -- that is, made into
! LVI -- all four sums come out too LARGE, and the first link, IBH34,
! becomes a branch to 004312.00, which is IBH40: the exit.  The block
! branches straight past its own chain and halts normally.  All three
! manufactured words are wrong and the PC check passes.  The word
! checks are what catch it, and they are the reason this entry has
! them.

        SLC, (8)4301.0
IBH30   LVNI, $X1, 0.32
        V+, $X1, IBH39
        SV, $X1, IBH34
IBH31   LVNI, $X1, 1.0
        V+, $X1, IBH39
        SV, $X1, IBH36
IBH32   LVNI, $X1, 1.32
        V+, $X1, IBH39
        SV, $X1, IBH38
IBH33   LVNI, $X1, 2.0
        V+, $X1, IBH39
        SV, $X1, IBH37
IBH34   BE, $                                ! becomes BD, IBH38
IBH35   BD, IBH40                            ! remains BD, IBH40
IBH36   BE, $                                ! becomes BD, IBH37
IBH37   BE, $                                ! becomes BD, IBH35
IBH38   BE, $                                ! becomes BD, IBH36
IBH39   BD, $                                ! also the V+ operand: 4311.44
IBH40   NOP, (8)777777.0                     ! executed as NOP
        NOP, (8)777777.0                     ! executed as NOP
PASS    BEW, $
        END, IBH30
